{title: Restoration}
{artist: Clay Edwards}
{key: A}
{capo: 2}

{comment: Chorus}
You bring [A]restoration
You bring [E]restoration
You bring [D]restoration [F#m]  to my [D]soul

{comment: Verse}
You've taken my [A]pain
And You called me by a new [C#m]name
You've taken my [D]shame,
In its [A]place,
You give me [E]joy!

{comment: Chorus 2}
[A]You take my mourning, turn it into dancing (You give me [C#m]joy)
You take my weeping, turn it into laughing (You give me [D]joy)
You take my mourning, [F#m]turn it into dancing (to my [E]soul)
You take my sadness, turn it into joy (you give me joy[A])

{comment: Bridge}
[A]Hallelujah! Hallelujah!
You make [E]all things new,  all things new
[D]Hallelujah! [F#m]Hallelujah!
You make [E]all things new,  all things new
